        ],
        "summary": "get retrieval binding revision",
        "description": "Project-owned query-only binding for an operator-managed Knowledge Base, RAG corpus or search index. Configure permission and project-change authority are required for writes. Every revision pins explicit API-key grants, one route target, native backend resource and field mappings. Queries require current published certified provider authority. Index creation and synchronization are excluded.",
